.59, "text": "Here is what Fable did for me. As you understand, I'm currently at this like vacation in California. I wanted Fable to help me plan this whole thing. So, here's like at a glance all the plans. And then I asked you to build a website. And th", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=pFlLqO3oUoc\u0026t=3s", "end": 161.0, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "40a71f6ff34905c4f34d586637c691f8d37ce07a21fab800363f3c9c54bd4498", "start": 3.59, "text": " newspaper for every day of the week that tells the kids what we're going to do. There's like an expedition passport here. There's coloring books. It's just crazy. So I asked it to go on this like little adventure and Fable just Fable Max c", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=pFlLqO3oUoc\u0026t=3s", "end": 161.0, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "047b249c0e5cc71cc037e26446a5095bbdfe159dbe76317fbb2822ca953b8744", "start": 3.59, "text": " open this on my phone? Will I be able to see the checked items that I did on my Mac? He's like, \"No, but let me fix this.\" In a second. It connected like KV. I don't even know. Yeah, I know it did it on cloud. So, it deployed it and now I ", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}], "hint": {"kind": "opening_prose", "text": "\u003c!-- HOOK_START --\u003e \u003c!-- HOOK_END --\u003e I had Claude Fable design my vacation plans and I'm stunned! For this itinerary, fable max was required. But the result did not disappoint. Fable not only gave me a detailed list of stops, it created a custom packing list for each member on the trip, as well as a newspaper with activities to distribute throughout. This is one of those pet projects that you can't stop marveling over how cool it really is. #thursdai #aiwork #aiengineer #vacationplanning #ai 🔗 Subscribe to our show on Spotify: thursdai.news/spotify 🔗 Apple: thursdai.news/apple 🔗 Youtube: thur", "truncated": true}, "platform": 